  "updated_at": "2026-01-12T11:29:23.539667+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.1700782",
  "reference": "Geyer R, Jambeck JR, Law KL. Production, use, and fate of all plastics ever made. Science Advances. 2017;3(7):e1700782."
